2", "translation": "Ὦ δῖος αἰθήρ καὶ ταχύπτεροι [O divine ether and swift-winged]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note3", "translation": "Πνοαὶ δ᾽ ἀπὸ Στρυμόνος [And breezes from the Strymon]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note4", "translation": "Ναῦς γὰρ πρὸς ἀλλή-λαισι Θρήκιαι [For Thracian ships against each other]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note5", "translation": "Ἀχείματόν μ᾽ ἔπεμπε σὺν [It sent me stormless with]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note6", "translation": "φίλαις ego addidi [with friendly (breezes) I added]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note7", "translation": "Βορεάδας ἥξεις πρὸς [You will come to the sons of Boreas]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note8", "translation": "Ἅς θνητὸς οὐδεὶς εἰσιδὼν ἕξει [Which no mortal having seen will possess]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note9", "translation": "Πρὶν [Before]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note10", "translation": "Πνοαῖς ῎Αρεος [With the blasts of Ares]"}, {"id": "pnoe-note11", "translation": "Συνθνήσκουσα δὲ σποδός προπέμπει πίονας πλούτου [And the dying ash sends forth rich (vapors) of wealth]"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote1", "translation": "breaths"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote2", "translation": "breezes"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote3", "translation": "having come"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote4", "translation": "the breezes tore"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote5", "translation": "with friendly breezes"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote6", "translation": "breaths"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote7", "translation": "breaths"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote8", "translation": "to storm with the blasts of Ares"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote9", "translation": "being stirred"}, {"id": "pnoe-quote10", "translation": "breaths"}, {"id": "pnoe-word1", "translation": "And this Aegina lies toward the south"}, {"id": "pnoe-word2", "translation": "O divine ether and swift-winged"}, {"id": "pnoe-word3", "translation": "And breezes from the Strymon"}, {"id": "pnoe-word4", "translation": "For Thracian ships against each other"}, {"id": "pnoe-word5", "translation": "It sent me stormless with"}, {"id": "pnoe-word6", "translation": "with friendly (breezes)"}, {"id": "pnoe-word7", "translation": "You will come to the